msgstr "個別の営業時間を指定"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1231
msgid ""
"Since it is registered as a weekly regular holiday, it will be treated as "
"closed."
msgstr "毎週の定休日として登録されているため休業扱いになります。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1300
msgid "shift screen"
msgstr "シフト画面"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1303
msgid ""
"The settings in the holiday and day-before-holiday rows are not currently "
"used when creating shifts."
msgstr "祝日・祝日前日の行の設定は、現在シフトの作成には使われません。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1305
msgid " Holidays and days before holidays follow the regular weekday hours."
msgstr "祝日も曜日どおりの営業時間でシフトが作られます。"

#. translators: %s: link to the shift screen.
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1309
msgid " To change the hours for a specific day, set them on the %s."
msgstr "営業時間を変える日は、%sでその日ごとに設定してください。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1319
msgid "Website URL"
msgstr "ウェブサイト URL"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1330
msgid ""
"Use it as a link in notification emails and on the reservation completion "
"screen."
msgstr "通知メールや予約完了画面でリンクとして利用します。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1340
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1343
msgid "Industry preset"
msgstr "業種プリセット"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1351
msgid "Industry presets are available in the Pro edition."
msgstr "業種プリセットは Pro 版でご利用いただけます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1362
msgid ""
"When you select an industry, only the items commonly used in that industry "
"are displayed, with representative values entered in advance. Other items "
"are configured automatically and are no longer displayed on this screen."
msgstr ""
"業種を選ぶと、その業種でよく使う項目だけが表示され、代表的な値があらかじめ入"
"力されます。それ以外の項目は自動で設定され、この画面には表示されなくなりま"
"す。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1363
msgid "Select \"Custom\" to configure all items individually (initial state)."
msgstr "「カスタム」を選ぶと、すべての項目を個別に設定できます（初期状態）。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1364
msgid ""
"If you select \"Lodging\", you can create plans by the night in service "
"menus, and customers choose a check-in date, check-out date, and room on the "
"reservation screen."
msgstr ""
"「宿泊」を選ぶと、サービスメニューで泊単位のプランを作成でき、予約画面では"
"チェックイン日・チェックアウト日と客室を選ぶ流れになります。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1365
msgid ""
"If you switch from \"Lodging\" to another industry, plans set by the night "
"are handled as time slot plans."
msgstr ""
"「宿泊」から別の業種へ戻すと、泊単位に設定していたプランは時間枠のプランとし"
"て扱われます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1365
msgid ""
"Days that were set as sale days in \"Lodging\" have no time slots, so no "
"vacancies appear for time slot plans until you set the time slots in the "
"shift of each month."
msgstr ""
"「宿泊」で販売日にしていた日は時間帯が空のため、各月のシフトで時間帯を設定し"
"直すまで、時間枠のプランに空きは表示されません。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1370
msgid ""
"These items are automatically saved with these values and cannot be changed "
"individually on this screen. Select \"Custom\" to configure them "
"individually."
msgstr ""
"これらの項目は保存時にこの内容で自動的に登録され、この画面では個別に変更でき"
"ません。個別に設定したい場合は「カスタム」を選んでください。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1380
#: src/admin/class-setup-notices.php:389
msgid "Reservation page URL"
msgstr "予約ページ URL"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1392
msgid ""
"Place a \"reservation block\" on the fixed page you want to use as a "
"reservation page, and then enter the public URL of that fixed page."
msgstr ""
"予約ページとして使用する固定ページに「予約ブロック」を配置した上で、その固定"
"ページの公開URLを入力してください。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1398
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2687
msgid "Reservation page display elements"
msgstr "予約ページの表示要素"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1409
msgid "logo image"
msgstr "ロゴ画像"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1429
msgid "Filter search"
msgstr "絞り込み検索"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1440
msgid "Filter by date"
msgstr "日付で絞り込む"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1452
msgid "Resource tag search"
msgstr "リソースタグ検索"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1463
msgid "Service menu list"
msgstr "サービスメニュー一覧"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1474
msgid "Footer"
msgstr "フッター"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1479
msgid ""
"If neither \"Filter search\" nor \"Service menu list\" is checked, only the "
"filter search (selecting the menu, etc. from dropdowns) will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"「絞り込み検索」「サービスメニュー一覧」のどちらもチェックしない場合は、メ"
"ニューなどをプルダウンで選ぶ「絞り込み検索」のみが表示されます。"

#. translators: Prefix label shown before the description of the "Filter by date" checkbox. Includes the colon separator.
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1484
msgid "Filter by date:"
msgstr "日付で絞り込む："

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1486
msgid ""
"Adds a date field to the filter search. Only the service menus that can be "
"booked on the selected date are shown in the list and the menu dropdown."
msgstr ""
"絞り込み検索に日付の入力欄を追加します。選んだ日に予約できるサービスメニュー"
"だけが、一覧とメニューのプルダウンに表示されます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1487
msgid ""
"On lodging sites, the check-in date, check-out date, and number of nights "
"fields are displayed instead of the date field."
msgstr ""
"宿泊のサイトでは、日付の欄の代わりに、チェックイン日・チェックアウト日・泊数"
"の欄が表示されます。"

#. translators: Prefix label shown before the description of the "Footer" checkbox. Includes the colon separator.
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1492
msgid "Footer:"
msgstr "フッター："

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1494
msgid ""
"Displays the business information (business name, address, phone number, and "
"business hours text) and links to the cancellation policy, system terms of "
"use, and privacy policy at the end of the reservation block."
msgstr ""
"予約ブロックの末尾に、事業者情報（事業者名・住所・電話番号・営業時間のテキス"
"ト）と、キャンセルポリシー・システム利用規約・プライバシーポリシーへのリンク"
"を表示します。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1495
msgid ""
"When the website URL differs from the reservation page URL, a \"Website\" "
"link is also displayed at the left end of the links."
msgstr ""
"ウェブサイト URL が予約ページ URL と異なるときは、リンクの左端に「ウェブサイ"
"ト」リンクも表示します。"

#. translators: 1: link to the "Business information" tab, 2: link to the "User consent items" tab.
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1500
msgid "The displayed content uses the values entered in %1$s and %2$s."
msgstr "表示する内容は、%1$s と %2$s に入力した値を使います。"

#. translators: %s: link to the footer color settings on the "design settings" tab.
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1508
msgid "The background color and text color can be changed on the %s tab."
msgstr "背景色・文字色は%sタブで変更できます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1520
msgid "Service menu display mode"
msgstr "サービスメニュー表示モード"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1528
#: src/post-types/class-service-menu-post-type.php:1339
#: src/post-types/class-service-menu-post-type.php:1367
#: src/blocks/menu-loop/edit.js:31
msgid "card"
msgstr "カード"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1531
#: src/post-types/class-service-menu-post-type.php:1338
#: src/post-types/class-service-menu-post-type.php:1366
#: src/blocks/menu-loop/edit.js:32
msgid "text"
msgstr "テキスト"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1541
msgid "Service menu detail page display method"
msgstr "サービスメニュー詳細ページの表示方法"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1550
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1557
msgid "Display within the reservation block"
msgstr "予約ブロック内で表示"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1553
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1563
msgid "Display as a WordPress individual post"
msgstr "WordPressの個別投稿として表示"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1559
msgid ""
"The detail page of a service menu is displayed inside the reservation block "
"of the reservation page."
msgstr ""
"サービスメニューの詳細ページを、予約ページの予約ブロック内に表示します。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1560
msgid ""
"Customers can proceed to the reservation screen without leaving the "
"reservation page."
msgstr "お客様は予約ページから移動せずに、予約画面へ進めます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1561
msgid "The reservation page URL must be set."
msgstr "予約ページURLの設定が必要です。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1565
msgid ""
"The detail page of a service menu is displayed as an individual post of "
"WordPress."
msgstr "サービスメニューの詳細ページを、WordPressの個別投稿として表示します。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1566
msgid "The appearance depends on the post template of your theme."
msgstr "見た目は、テーマの投稿テンプレートによって決まります。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1569
msgid ""
"If \"Use\" is turned off for \"Details page\" of a service menu, the detail "
"page of that service menu is not displayed in either method."
msgstr ""
"サービスメニューの「詳細ページ」で「使用する」をオフにしている場合は、どちら"
"の方式でもそのサービスメニューの詳細ページは表示されません。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1573
msgid "Please set the reservation page URL to a URL of this site."
msgstr "予約ページURLを、このサイトのURLとして設定してください。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1574
msgid ""
"Until then, service menus are displayed as individual posts of WordPress "
"even if \"Display within the reservation block\" is selected."
msgstr ""
"設定するまでは、「予約ブロック内で表示」を選んでいても、サービスメニューは"
"WordPressの個別投稿として表示されます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1575
msgid "Set the reservation page URL"
msgstr "予約ページURLを設定する"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1585
msgid "Currency symbol"
msgstr "通貨記号"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1596
msgid ""
"Enter the currency symbol to display with prices (e.g., $, ¥, €). If left "
"empty, the default symbol based on the site language will be used."
msgstr ""
"価格とともに表示する通貨記号（例：$、¥、€）を入力してください。空欄のままにし"
"た場合は、サイトの言語に基づいたデフォルトの通貨記号が使用されます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1604
msgid "Tax label text"
msgstr "税込み表記テキスト"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1614
msgid ""
"Shown to the right of prices only when this field is filled (e.g., \"(tax "
"included)\")."
msgstr ""
"このフィールドが入力されている場合にのみ、価格の右側に表示されます（例："
"「（税込）」）。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1627
msgid "Pre-holidays and special dates (lodging plan prices)"
msgstr "休前日・特定日（宿泊プランの料金）"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1630
msgid "Days of the week treated as pre-holidays"
msgstr "休前日とする曜日"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1646
msgid ""
"Nights that start on the selected days of the week are priced as pre-"
"holidays. A night before a public holiday is always a pre-holiday, whatever "
"the day of the week."
msgstr ""
"選んだ曜日にチェックインする泊は、休前日の料金になります。祝日の前日の泊は、"
"曜日に関係なく休前日の料金になります。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1650
msgid "Special dates"
msgstr "特定日"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1661
msgid "+ Add period"
msgstr "+ 期間を追加"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1677
msgid ""
"Nights that start on a day in the period, including the end date, are priced "
"as special dates. If the special date price of a plan is empty, the night is "
"priced as a pre-holiday or a weekday instead."
msgstr ""
"期間内（終了日を含む）の日にチェックインする泊は、特定日の料金になります。プ"
"ランの特定日の料金が空欄の場合、その泊は休前日または平日の料金で計算します。"

#. translators: %s: link to the service menu list.
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1684
msgid ""
"Set the regular, pre-holiday, and special date prices of each plan on the "
"edit screen of each %s."
msgstr "平日・休前日・特定日の料金は、プランごとに%sの編集画面で設定します。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1685
msgid "service menu"
msgstr "サービスメニュー"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1695
msgid "Reservation slot time"
msgstr "予約スロットの時間"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1702
msgid "10 minutes"
msgstr "10分"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1703
msgid "15 minutes"
msgstr "15分"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1704
msgid "20 minutes"
msgstr "20分"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1705
msgid "30 minutes"
msgstr "30分"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1706
msgid "60 minutes"
msgstr "60分"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1709
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1731
msgid "This setting applies only to time slot plans."
msgstr "この設定は時間枠のプランにだけ効きます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1709
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1731
msgid " It is not used for lodging plans."
msgstr "泊のプランには使いません。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1716
#: src/post-types/class-service-menu-post-type.php:289
#: src/post-types/class-service-menu-post-type.php:712
msgid "Post-service buffer"
msgstr "サービス後バッファ"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1727
#: src/post-types/class-service-menu-post-type.php:702
#: src/post-types/class-service-menu-post-type.php:714
msgid "minutes"
msgstr "分"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1728
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:665
msgid ""
"During the service time plus the buffer time, new reservations will not be "
"accepted."
msgstr "サービス時間＋バッファ時間の間は新規予約を受け付けません。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1729
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1751
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1774
msgid "If there is an input for each service menu, that will take priority."
msgstr "各サービスメニューで入力がある場合はそちらが優先されます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1738
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:430
#: src/post-types/class-service-menu-post-type.php:288
#: src/post-types/class-service-menu-post-type.php:706
msgid "Reservation deadline"
msgstr "予約締切"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1749
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:433
#: src/post-types/class-service-menu-post-type.php:708
msgid "hours ago"
msgstr "時間前"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1758
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:452
msgid "Max advance booking period"
msgstr "予約可能な最大日数"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1769
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2994
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:455
msgid "days"
msgstr "日"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1771
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:457
msgid ""
"The maximum number of days in advance that reservations can be made. Set to "
"0 for no limit."
msgstr ""
"本日から何日先までの予約を受付可能かを指定する事ができます。0の場合は無制限"
"（シフト登録のある日時）となります。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1781
#: src/bookings/class-booking-admin.php:619
#: src/bookings/class-booking-admin.php:1411
#: src/bookings/class-booking-admin.php:1587
msgid "Reservation status"
msgstr "予約ステータス"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1789
msgid "Instant confirmation"
msgstr "即時確定"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1792
msgid "Make a tentative reservation"
msgstr "仮予約にする"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1796
msgid ""
"For tentative reservations, a reservation confirmation email will be sent to "
"the user even when the reservation is changed to confirmed."
msgstr ""
"仮予約の場合、確定に変更された時点でもユーザーに予約確定メールが送信されま"
"す。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1797
msgid ""
"*Reservations made by users with administrator privileges and salon "
"privileges will be confirmed immediately."
msgstr ""
"※ 管理者権限及びサロン側の権限を持つユーザーによる予約の場合は即時確定になり"
"ます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1805
msgid "Guidance text for tentative reservation completion"
msgstr "仮予約完了時の案内文"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1814
msgid ""
"This text is displayed below the heading \"Your tentative reservation has "
"been received.\" on the screen shown after a tentative reservation is "
"completed."
msgstr ""
"仮予約が完了した画面で、見出し「仮予約を受け付けました」の下に表示する文章で"
"す。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1815
msgid ""
"You can rewrite it to match how your store operates, such as when you will "
"confirm the reservation (for example, \"We will contact you within 24 hours."
"\") and how you will contact the customer."
msgstr ""
"予約を確定するまでの目安（例: 24時間以内にご連絡します）や連絡方法など、お店"
"の運用に合わせて書き換えられます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1816
msgid "If left blank, the standard text below is displayed."
msgstr "空欄のときは、下記の標準の文章が表示されます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1817
msgid "HTML tags cannot be used, and line breaks are displayed as entered."
msgstr "HTML タグは使えません。改行は入力したとおりに表示されます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1818
msgid "The text of emails does not change."
msgstr "メールの文面は変わりません。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1821
msgid "Standard text:"
msgstr "標準の文章:"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1830
msgid "Reservation cancellation"
msgstr "予約キャンセル"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1834
msgid "Cancellation of reservations via the web by users"
msgstr "ユーザーによるウェブからの予約キャンセル"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1841
msgid "time specification"
msgstr "時間指定"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1844
msgid "Cannot be canceled"
msgstr "キャンセル不可"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1862
msgid "until the hour"
msgstr "時間前まで"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1868
msgid "Duplicate reservations for the same staff"
msgstr "同一スタッフの予約重複"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1878
msgid "Permitted only if specified from the management screen"
msgstr "管理画面からの指定の場合に限り許可"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1881
msgid ""
"Duplicate reservations for the same staff member in the same time slot will "
"only be permitted if manually specified by the staff member from the "
"management screen."
msgstr ""
"同一スタッフの同じ時間帯での重複予約について、管理画面からスタッフによる手動"
"指定の場合に限って許可します。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1890
msgid "membership"
msgstr "メンバーシップ"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1899
msgid "Allow anyone to register as a user"
msgstr "だれでもユーザー登録ができるようにする"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1902
msgid "*This is the same as the standard WordPress “Membership” settings."
msgstr "※ WordPress 標準の「メンバーシップ」設定と共通です。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1909
msgid "Email authentication during user registration"
msgstr "ユーザー登録時のメール認証"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1920
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1938
msgid "enable"
msgstr "有効化する"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1923
msgid ""
"Uncheck to skip email authentication and enable the user upon registration "
"(mainly for local or test environments)."
msgstr ""
"チェックを外すとメール認証をスキップし、登録と同時にユーザーを有効にします"
"（主にローカルやテスト環境用）。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1929
msgid "Registration/Login Attempt Limit"
msgstr "登録・ログイン試行回数制限"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1942
msgid "User registration"
msgstr "ユーザー登録"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1953
