"Disable the WordPress new user registration screen and redirect to this "
"system's user registration screen"
msgstr ""
"WordPressの新規ユーザー登録画面を無効にし、このシステムのユーザー登録画面にリ"
"ダイレクトします"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1998
msgid ""
"Even if WordPress's \"Membership (which allows anyone to register as a user)"
"\" is enabled, wp-login.php?action=register will direct you to the "
"registration screen of this system."
msgstr ""
"WordPress の「メンバーシップ（だれでもユーザー登録できるようにする）」が有効"
"な場合でも、wp-login.php?action=register を本システムの登録画面へ誘導します。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2003
msgid "Login screen redirection"
msgstr "ログイン画面のリダイレクト"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2012
