"Enter the terms of use for the entire service, including membership "
"registration, prohibitions, and disclaimers."
msgstr "会員登録・禁止事項・免責事項など、サービス全体の利用規約を入力します。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2081
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2123
